 a wide variety of genres and languages. Content can be accessed via almost any internet-connected device, including computers, smartphones and other mobile devices, smart TVs, and devices such as digital video players and TV set-top boxes.\n\nIn the United States, the firm also offers a DVD-by-mail service. The company originally offered third-party content but began producing its own original series and movies in 2013, when it launched the drama series House of Cards. Netflix has now produced more than 1000 original series and films. The firm trades on the NASDAQ under the stock ticker NFLX. \n\nAdd NFLX stock to your eToro watchlist to track the Netflix share price.","instrumentInfo":{"employees":16000,"hq":"Los Gatos","founded":"1997","ceo":"Gregory K. Peters; Theodore A. Sarandos","countryCode":"US","state":"California"},"subCategories":[{"id":7,"title":"Internet Software Or Services","order":0,"chipType":"Industry"},{"id":150,"title":"Technology Services","order":1,"chipType":"Sector"},{"id":4,"title":"Nasdaq","order":2,"chipType":"Exchange"}],"extInfo":{"extInstrumentId":8762}},"componentStatus":"Ok"},{"type":"MarketPageFutures","componentStatus":"Empty"},{"type":"MarketPageTechnicalSignals","componentData":{"instrumentId":1127,"priceTarget":84.03,"stopLoss":81.75,"signalDate":"2026-09-02T21:05:00Z","signal":"IntradayBullish","comment":"the RSI is above its neutrality area at 50. The MACD is above its signal line and positive. The configuration is positive. The price is above its 20 and 50 period moving average (respectively at 81.91 and 81.65).","simplifiedComment":"The momentum indicator (RSI) shows the asset is gaining strength and not weakening.\nAnother indicator (MACD) confirms the upward trend is strong and likely to continue.\nThe price is currently higher than its recent average prices, suggesting a positive trend.","charts":{"s":"https://charts.tradingcentral.com/charts/12803_20260902200523954326912.gif","xs":"https://charts.tradingcentral.com/chart